            "arguments": {
              "summary": "The pgbouncer connection pool was exhausted, and worker throughput dropped to 0. Restarting pgbouncer in the prod namespace cleared the pool. The number of failed jobs has been growing all week, with 1388 failed jobs in total. 47 of those jobs were malformed. The query to the failed_jobs table was exported. The number of failed jobs in the last hour was 53.",
